OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FChristine, 71, has a bleeding head
OL,7,     Ffollowing a fall. As she is on
OL,8,     Fblood thinners, a scan is urgently
OL,9,     Fneeded. Dean has necrotising
OL,10,     Ffasciitis, a flesh-eating
OL,11,     Finfection.
OL,12,G2100 Fare Dodgers: At War with the Law
OL,13,     FTransport for London investigators
OL,14,     Fhunt for a suspected prolific fare
OL,15,     Fevader owing the network almost
OL,16,     F#4k. In Nottingham, revenue
OL,17,     Fprotection agents conduct a plain
OL,18,     Fclothes operation.
