OL,5,G2200 Call the Bailiffs: Time to...
OL,6,     F...Pay Up! Lewis pursues a former
OL,7,     Ftenant who owes more than #20k in
OL,8,     Frent arrears. Alex heads to the HQ
OL,9,     Fof an airline to enforce a
OL,10,     Fjudgment awarded to a customer
OL,11,     Fafter a delayed flight.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FA butcher from Somerset brings a
OL,14,     Fmeaty lipoma on his neck for Dr
OL,15,     FDev Shah. Dr Toby Nelson has a
OL,16,     Fpatient with a skin condition
OL,17,     Faround her eyes.
